  // chess coach
  'Chess coach': 'Shaxmat murabbiyi',
  'Free Chess Coach for Every Game You Play · Shohmot': 'Har bir o‘yiningiz uchun bepul shaxmat murabbiyi · Shohmot',
  'Free chess coach': 'Bepul shaxmat murabbiyi',
  'A chess coach for every game you {0}': 'Har bir {0} o‘yiningiz uchun shaxmat murabbiyi',
  'play.': 'o‘ynagan',
  'Fischer, Shohmot’s chess coach, goes through your games with you: what happened on each move, the better move, and the lesson in it. Read it or hear it aloud. And if you coach players yourself, invite your students and see every one’s week on one page.': 'Shohmot’ning shaxmat murabbiyi Fischer o‘yinlaringizni siz bilan birga ko‘rib chiqadi: har bir yurishda nima bo‘ldi, yaxshiroq yurish va undan saboq. O‘qing yoki ovozli tinglang. O‘zingiz murabbiy bo‘lsangiz, o‘quvchilaringizni taklif qiling va har birining haftasini bitta sahifada ko‘ring.',
  'Fischer, your free chess coach, talks you through every move of your games. Chess coaches get a dashboard with every student’s games, losses and rating.': 'Bepul shaxmat murabbiyingiz Fischer o‘yinlaringizning har bir yurishini tushuntiradi. Shaxmat murabbiylari har bir o‘quvchining o‘yinlari, mag‘lubiyatlari va reytingi bilan panelga ega bo‘ladi.',
  'Every move explained, out loud if you like': 'Har bir yurish tushuntiriladi, xohlasangiz ovoz bilan',
  'Your mistakes turned into training': 'Xatolaringiz mashqqa aylantiriladi',
  'For chess coaches: every student’s week on one page': 'Shaxmat murabbiylari uchun: har bir o‘quvchining haftasi bitta sahifada',
  'Every move explained': 'Har bir yurish tushuntiriladi',
  'What happened, the better move and the lesson in it, move by move, in plain words.': 'Nima bo‘ldi, yaxshiroq yurish va undan saboq — yurishma-yurish, oddiy so‘zlar bilan.',
  'Hear it aloud': 'Ovoz bilan tinglang',
  'Turn on Fischer’s voice and listen while you watch the board.': 'Fischer ovozini yoqing va taxtaga qarab turib tinglang.',
  'Then train it': 'Keyin mashq qiling',
  'With a free account, your mistakes become positions you solve until you find the right move every time.': 'Bepul hisob bilan xatolaringiz to‘g‘ri yurishni har safar topguningizcha yechiladigan pozitsiyalarga aylanadi.',
  'For chess coaches': 'Shaxmat murabbiylari uchun',
  'Send your students one invite link. They join with a free account and their Chess.com and Lichess usernames.': 'O‘quvchilaringizga bitta taklif havolasini yuboring. Ular bepul hisob va Chess.com hamda Lichess nomlari bilan qo‘shiladi.',
  'Every student’s week': 'Har bir o‘quvchining haftasi',
  'Games today and this week, how many they lost, and their rating change, with whoever played last on top.': 'Bugungi va shu haftadagi o‘yinlar, nechtasida yutqazgani va reyting o‘zgarishi; oxirgi o‘ynagan eng tepada.',
  'Ready for the lesson': 'Darsga tayyor',
  'Open a student’s last games and review any of them with Stockfish before you meet.': 'Uchrashishdan oldin o‘quvchining so‘nggi o‘yinlarini oching va istalganini Stockfish bilan tahlil qiling.',
  'Find your games by username, or paste a Lichess link or PGN.': 'O‘yinlaringizni nomingiz bo‘yicha toping yoki Lichess havolasi yoxud PGN joylang.',
  '{0}Find your games by username, or paste a Lichess link or PGN.': '{0}O‘yinlaringizni nomingiz bo‘yicha toping yoki Lichess havolasi yoxud PGN joylang.',
  'Listen to Fischer': 'Fischer’ni tinglang',
  'Step through the moves and hear what each one did.': 'Yurishlarni birma-bir ko‘ring va har biri nima qilganini eshiting.',
  '{0}Step through the moves and hear what each one did.': '{0}Yurishlarni birma-bir ko‘ring va har biri nima qilganini eshiting.',
  'Coaching players?': 'O‘yinchilarni o‘qitasizmi?',
  'Settings → Coach gives you an invite link for your students.': 'Sozlamalar → Murabbiy bo‘limi o‘quvchilaringiz uchun taklif havolasini beradi.',
  '{0}Settings → Coach gives you an invite link for your students.': '{0}Sozlamalar → Murabbiy bo‘limi o‘quvchilaringiz uchun taklif havolasini beradi.',
  'Get a game coached': 'O‘yiningizni murabbiyga ko‘rsating',
  'Chess coach: Fischer explains a move, and a coach sees each student\'s week': 'Shaxmat murabbiyi: Fischer yurishni tushuntiradi, murabbiy esa har bir o‘quvchining haftasini ko‘radi',
