  'A free board for playing out any position, with a live Stockfish that follows every move and shows you its top three lines.': 'Istalgan pozitsiyani o‘ynash uchun bepul taxta: jonli Stockfish har bir yurishni kuzatadi va eng yaxshi uchta variantini ko‘rsatadi.',
  'Play out any idea with a live Stockfish at your side: top three lines, the best move as an arrow, and variations as deep as you like.': 'Yoningizdagi jonli Stockfish bilan istalgan g‘oyani o‘ynab ko‘ring: eng yaxshi uchta variant, eng yaxshi yurish strelkasi va xohlagancha chuqur variantlar.',
  'Live Stockfish: top %n lines and a best-move arrow': 'Jonli Stockfish: eng yaxshi %n ta variant va eng yaxshi yurish strelkasi',
  'Variations nested as deep as you like': 'Xohlagancha chuqur ichma-ich variantlar',
  'Load and copy PGN or FEN': 'PGN yoki FEN yuklash va nusxalash',
  'Variations, nested': 'Ichma-ich variantlar',
  'Go back and play something else: it becomes a variation under the move it replaces. Promote or delete lines with a right-click.': 'Orqaga qaytib, boshqa yurish qiling: u almashtirgan yurish ostida variantga aylanadi. Variantlarni o‘ng tugma bilan ko‘taring yoki o‘chiring.',
  'Live engine': 'Jonli dvigatel',
  'Top three lines, the best move as a blue arrow and the eval bar. Click a move in a line to play up to it.': 'Eng yaxshi uchta variant, eng yaxshi yurish ko‘k strelka bilan va baho chizig‘i. Variantdagi yurishni bossangiz, o‘sha joygacha o‘ynaladi.',
  'PGN and FEN': 'PGN va FEN',
  'Load a PGN with variations, comments and annotations, or a FEN. Copy either back out.': 'Variantlar, izohlar va belgilar bilan PGN yoki FEN yuklang. Ikkalasini ham nusxalab olish mumkin.',
  'Opening names': 'Debyut nomlari',
  'From Lichess’s openings list, plus a red glow on a king in check and the result when the game ends.': 'Lichess debyutlar ro‘yxatidan; shoh berilganda shoh qizil yonadi, o‘yin tugaganda natija ko‘rsatiladi.',
  'Straight from a review': 'To‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri tahlildan',
  'Open any reviewed game on the board at the move you’re looking at.': 'Tahlil qilingan istalgan o‘yinni taxtada aynan ko‘rayotgan yurishingizda oching.',
  'Picks up where you left off': 'To‘xtagan joyingizdan davom etadi',
  'Your analysis is kept in the browser, so it’s still there after a reload.': 'Tahlilingiz brauzerda saqlanadi, shuning uchun sahifa yangilangandan keyin ham joyida.',
  'Open the board': 'Taxtani ochish',
