  'Build any position. Then play it {0}': 'Istalgan pozitsiyani tuzing. Keyin uni {0}',
  'out.': 'o‘ynab ko‘ring.',
  'Put pieces wherever you like and Shohmot checks the position is legal. Then play it against Stockfish at one of six strengths, or let it play itself.': 'Donalarni xohlagan joyingizga qo‘ying, Shohmot pozitsiya qoidaga mosligini tekshiradi. So‘ng uni oltita kuch darajasidan birida Stockfish’ga qarshi o‘ynang yoki o‘zi bilan o‘ynashiga qo‘ying.',
  'Build any position, check it’s legal, then play it out against Stockfish at six strengths, or watch it play itself.': 'Istalgan pozitsiyani tuzing, qoidaga mosligini tekshiring, so‘ng uni oltita kuch darajasida Stockfish’ga qarshi o‘ynang yoki uning o‘zi bilan o‘ynashini tomosha qiling.',
  'Click, drag or paint pieces onto the board': 'Donalarni bosib, sudrab yoki “bo‘yab” taxtaga qo‘ying',
  'Tells you what makes a position illegal': 'Pozitsiyani nima noqonuniy qilishini aytadi',
  'Six Stockfish strengths, Beginner to Maximum': 'Stockfish’ning oltita kuchi: “Boshlovchi”dan “Maksimal”gacha',
  'Click, drag, paint': 'Bosing, sudrang, bo‘yang',
  'Pick a piece and click or drag across squares to place it. Right-click empties a square; drag a piece off to remove it.': 'Donani tanlang va uni qo‘yish uchun kataklarni bosing yoki ular bo‘ylab sudrang. O‘ng tugma katakni bo‘shatadi; olib tashlash uchun donani taxtadan tashqariga suring.',
  'Legal, or why not': 'Qonuniy yoki nega emas',
  'It says what’s wrong: a missing king, pawns on the back rank, the side not to move in check.': 'Nima noto‘g‘riligini aytadi: shoh yo‘q, piyodalar chetki qatorda, yurish navbati bo‘lmagan tomonga shoh berilgan.',
  'Side to move and castling': 'Yurish navbati va rokirovka',
  'Choose who’s to move, and only the castling rights the king and rook allow.': 'Kim yurishini tanlang; rokirovka huquqi faqat shoh va ruh joylashuvi ruxsat berganda.',
  'Six strengths': 'Oltita kuch darajasi',
  'Beginner, Casual, Intermediate, Advanced, Expert and Maximum.': 'Boshlovchi, Havaskor, O‘rta, Ilg‘or, Ekspert va Maksimal.',
  'Watch or play': 'Tomosha qiling yoki o‘ynang',
  'Stockfish against itself (slow, normal or fast), or against you, with its lines hidden and a Take back button.': 'Stockfish o‘ziga qarshi (sekin, oddiy yoki tez) yoki sizga qarshi — variantlari yashirilgan va “Qaytarish” tugmasi bilan.',
  'Into the move tree': 'Yurishlar daraxtiga',
  'Every move goes into the tree like any other, so you can analyse the game afterwards.': 'Har bir yurish boshqalar kabi daraxtga tushadi, shuning uchun o‘yinni keyin tahlil qila olasiz.',
